{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "49e14e86c65805eead9b897da6263a2d36406f359efdf11976339f440204b7f3", "ja": "（真美が何しても「カワイイ！」って褒めてくれるの、\nなかなかテンションが上がりますなぁ）", "zh": "（不管真美做什么，都夸真美“可爱”，还真是让人情绪高涨呢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "7bede230ca041113f4443c150d31ea9019dc66036bacd208e48337f3d93386f4", "ja": "（でも真美がほしいのは「カワイイ」じゃなくて、\n「セクシー」とか「大人っぽい」なんだよね。うーむ）", "zh": "（可是，真美想要的不是“可爱”，而是“性感”或者“成熟”之类的，对吧。唔——）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "4f969dbf809a563999b44a090fd3abeef0b58aa01b3553e123edea9857245abe", "ja": "ねえねえ、假野さん。\nもしかして、真美ってちょっとコドモっぽい？", "zh": "呐呐，假野小姐。\n难道说，真美有点孩子气？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1020_kano", "source_sha256": "5a689bc5dd26b217a5ad069307e982e66b11c0bd2c1a2ea2417cb28e9577f6ad", "ja": "え？　そんな事ないと思いますけど……。\n誰かに言われたんですか？", "zh": "诶？我觉得没那回事啊……\n是谁这么说的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "40baf4e517bce30d6ed49b77ae5b65151ec524a3371771f741b4ffc224c471f0", "ja": "そーだよね！？　真美、自分では\nけっこうオトナっぽいと思うんだっ！", "zh": "就是嘛！？真美觉得自己还是挺有大人样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1022_012mam", "source_sha256": "f341817d29d7d077fe16c70720ad2039e1365d452d3ad90e76ad0c661a034ba1", "ja": "それなのに兄ちゃんってば、真美のコト\nぜーんぜん大人扱いしてくれないんだよ！", "zh": "明明是这样吧！？真美觉得自己已经挺像个大人了！\n\n可哥哥就是这样，完全不把真美当大人看待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1023_kano", "source_sha256": "dfd9e26336a4c9e7cecb8888e42c3ce7973b4f074d8ee180affb8fdf03ca9efb", "ja": "そっか。\n真美さん、お兄さんがいるんですね！", "zh": "这样啊。真美，你有哥哥呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1024_012mam", "source_sha256": "4f83b3d27be2305cc78e25011a43dbe1db4a8e0cdc08b4f154a13965d5b35d1e", "ja": "えっ？　あ、えっと、そんな感じ？", "zh": "诶？啊，这个嘛，差不多就是这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "995f43a9b367d4a7c131c2aa62dfec53bc6260c34e919ece4c0746ebb2d867e9", "ja": "（兄ちゃんは、真美の兄ちゃんじゃないんだけど……。\nうあうあ、どう説明したらいいのかわかんないよー！）", "zh": "（哥哥虽然不是哥哥的哥哥……呜啊呜啊，要怎么解释才好啊——！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1026_kano", "source_sha256": "97ac2b38d5c49286e2bfe9db9ede85f70d501585f4210e31c5fbb1a73ac03ad2", "ja": "うーん。でも、そうですね。\n真美さんみたいな可愛い子が自分の妹だったら……。", "zh": "嗯……不过，确实呢。\n要是有个像真美小姐这样可爱的孩子当自己的妹妹……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1027_kano", "source_sha256": "ae5b7d2416557cdc6b7e8074f81b9e2284785a695470c233d5db1e1f541d99e2", "ja": "心配で、かえってすごく\n子ども扱いしちゃうかもしれませんね。", "zh": "出于担心，说不定反而\n会特别把对方当成小孩子对待呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1028_012mam", "source_sha256": "14c97be82906451a980e393a70f6f7b69bee057e8256af2afe4cbd4292e22923", "ja": "えっ……。\nそ、そうなんだ。アハハ……。", "zh": "诶……\n原、原来是这样啊。哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1029_012mam", "source_sha256": "0b19652a77f761c608ad6bb04e771f2e1cf8a125669e38e03162f05c2fe4b9af", "ja": "（心配で、コドモ扱いする？\nそういうコトがあるの？）", "zh": "（因为担心，就把人当小孩子？\n还有这种事？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1030_012mam", "source_sha256": "565188102fae41dc7f8e85db6b85fd025e25e221b8f564ffa2b771dde22be268", "ja": "（もしかして、兄ちゃんもそうなのかな……？）", "zh": "（难道哥哥也是这样的吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1031_kano", "source_sha256": "d9dbba59eda8f7a20adbb9fb46e848212f82dafaa4a3298219bf345939c490b6", "ja": "真美さん？　どうかしましたか？", "zh": "真美小姐？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1032_012mam", "source_sha256": "8744fe2506c0f53126bb32813011521df3e47e0d87b6d01f385cac565d618944", "ja": "あっ、なんでもない！　それより、\n假野さんはテレビとかあんま見ないの？", "zh": "啊，没什么！比起这个，\n假野小姐平时不怎么……看电视之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
