{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1037_kano", "source_sha256": "2a225bfd4bfa31305518b7970445f59f20e7a459d497154d6685b30a70ef2e12", "ja": "もしかして、真美さんは芸能界に興味があるんですか？\n或いは、将来何になりたい……とか考えてますか？", "zh": "难道说，真美对演艺圈感兴趣吗？\n或者，有没有想过将来想成为什么样的人……之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1038_012mam", "source_sha256": "58c591b09c2328f21fa97275c02d71190520908c040b2455a98d62e8368fd545", "ja": "うーん、どうだろ？\n真美のパパは、お医者さんなんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯——怎么说呢？\n真美的爸爸是医生，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1039_012mam", "source_sha256": "004bcb11d52a26bec4c9c68489bebcc56f028f7ff56a9115b1b6a9fa22d5479e", "ja": "お医者さんになるには、いっぱい勉強しないとだって\nママが言ってたんだよね。真美、勉強はやだなー。", "zh": "妈妈说过，要当医生就得好好学习。真美不喜欢学习啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1040_kano", "source_sha256": "7b2131290643c2e72ccbaa81b3a436409e1dc3a12e719a845c269c162dad104f", "ja": "へ～、そうなんですね！\n真美さんって、もしかしてお嬢様？", "zh": "诶～原来是这样啊！  \n真美小姐，难道是大小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1041_012mam", "source_sha256": "b40d4b12f5f329f486e41abccf7dc5bb6d24a769dade7cfc05e162f2d0b02d22", "ja": "んっふっふ～。\nそんなこと……あるかも？", "zh": "嗯哼哼～。\n那种事……说不定也有可能哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1042_se", "source_sha256": "9a3e9215594bd0e1c3c47c2a673ca2e84b32a01ec364a487c8bb2abf1de6e1fd", "ja": "パシャッ", "zh": "咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1043_kano", "source_sha256": "d977014cffb0964941c1b40f3c00c34264b8e9e9bbd23d77fa6c55aa17468813", "ja": "真美さんは本当に表情が豊かですね。\n撮影し甲斐があります。", "zh": "真美的表情真是丰富多彩。很值得拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1044_kano", "source_sha256": "8aa464d348bb43b07e14a80e068811931d8dfcdd9315c35909ede1219daef7f0", "ja": "何人か撮影するつもりだったけど、\n真美さんひとりの写真集でも良さそうかも……。", "zh": "本来打算拍几个人的，不过只拍真美一个人的写真集，好像也不错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1045_012mam", "source_sha256": "9cee720fad34d42845dc692cf4ab9ef700fe18fc48500daa0c28b389741f2f74", "ja": "えーっ！？\n真美ひとりの写真集！？", "zh": "诶——！？\n只有真美一个人的写真集！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1046_012mam", "source_sha256": "6969c2f92e280d67632f2e767c2de77acd8d42b34a6456e39df291614964c0b7", "ja": "（そんなのメッチャうれしいけど……大丈夫かな？\nなんか、心配になってきちゃったよ～！）", "zh": "（那当然超级开心……可是，没问题吗？总觉得有点担心起来了～！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1047_kano", "source_sha256": "6622391386d203e45a5dd19c86046f2b68822a7253ea13741f620678689aa920", "ja": "あっ、そうそう。前に出した写真集持ってきたんです。\n重いから帰りに渡します、よかったら見てくださいね！", "zh": "啊，对了。我把之前发行的写真集带来了。\n因为很重，所以回去的时候再交给你。如果你愿意的话，请看看哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1048_012mam", "source_sha256": "2893c95c38d21c24173ab9561377b9eb15615851d0231737e99b18a49636bc16", "ja": "う、うん！　ありがとう……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯！谢谢你……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1050_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1051_032emi", "source_sha256": "9a44bcf260bf9786fb27cc8d3264080e9bacc4e77733ee99d0bb9bf4eac8eb3e", "ja": "真美さん、今日もお出かけなんですか？\n先日の写真作家さんと……。", "zh": "真美小姐，今天也要出门吗？\n和前几天那位摄影师一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1052_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1113c3ef61cabe2111648fd77cfc68f4e2df2b380e94b3ffd8dd3560b74ae1ee", "ja": "本当に、大丈夫なのですか？", "zh": "真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1053_012mam", "source_sha256": "dd7eb12106321ae59c54636bb23226ea9faa4f9ecff620b05e081fe73ce73c68", "ja": "うん！　全然、ヘーキヘーキ♪\nんじゃ、いってくるね！", "zh": "嗯！完全没问题♪\n那我先走啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1054_se", "source_sha256": "2e63bba24a33959cc8450a791941977259476309b8a28d2b83cc42baa1b8df2f", "ja": "ガチャ、バタン……", "zh": "咔嗒、砰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1055_040tam", "source_sha256": "6b31d69291d0dff941f6aa37fc11d00b065b0e8af9593d14db6fd932bac46c50", "ja": "う～ん。\nまみ、なんか元気なかったぞ……。", "zh": "嗯～。\n真美刚才好像没什么精神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1057_012mam", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1058_012mam", "source_sha256": "290365d9b6c19a6d3471920f558f12671ee20285339ac66b1168314f56c29a37", "ja": "（みんなには大丈夫って言ったけど。\n本当は、悪い気がしてるんだよね……）", "zh": "（虽然对大家说了没关系。其实，心里还是觉得过意不去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1059_012mam", "source_sha256": "3cc82350e9e60438c44ccf50af86d29567b2a1432f41d9abcc22f84e0cb9aa81", "ja": "でも、なんて言えばいいのかわからないし……\nん？", "zh": "可是，我也不知道该说什么才好……\n嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1060_p", "source_sha256": "fe878740b2e9fc1f36d60c2dcdfb216cb5f904b39783e5f8707391458293ee1a", "ja": "あれ？　真美、もう帰るのか？\n来週のスケジュール表持ってきたんだけど。", "zh": "咦？真美，你已经要回去了吗？\n我把下周的日程表带来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1061_012mam", "source_sha256": "d4ca70de6e8b381acb0e9f9625835412d8e17e1bd557b8832ef3241d07438911", "ja": "！！　真美急いでるから、あとでね！\nバイバーイ！", "zh": "！！真美赶时间，回头再说！拜拜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1062_p", "source_sha256": "9ac1b53fd512655c3311f2f51a026eeef20017af0c9e0774cdd4673e0d9f1dd7", "ja": "……？　真美……？", "zh": "……？　真美……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1063_012mam", "source_sha256": "6666764253aae368b60aa8a29c728efe9e96e84caafcdfbbfa676aab46d176c8", "ja": "（兄ちゃんに言ったら怒られそうだし……。やっぱ\nなんとかして、写真集はあきらめてもらうしかない！）", "zh": "（要是告诉哥哥，他肯定会生气的……果然还是得想办法让他放弃拍写真集！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1064_kano", "source_sha256": "447d413fac64f4d391c5aef835e30b0fe08c91ec9cdfd104ed47bf2b09aa0963", "ja": "ああ……せっかく真美さんに来てもらったのに、\n曇っちゃいましたね。", "zh": "啊……难得请真美小姐过来，却阴天了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1065_kano", "source_sha256": "34e4b7564ce8ae174ed35e2b87007b48830627351305753fb307abef36c76375", "ja": "今日は屋外はやめて、中にしましょうか。", "zh": "今天就不去室外了，改在室内吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1066_012mam", "source_sha256": "927f537aefb6a3f1cf8bc8748e59407d7ae2ebed658882f8f152680e337bc93f", "ja": "う、うん……。あのね、假野さん。\n真美、言ってなかったんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……那个，假野先生。真美之前没说过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1067_012mam", "source_sha256": "982b3fc09c7b456a13a5b93d8c4acad46dceedb794861958decb7f4e831800e9", "ja": "真美……実は、えっと……。", "zh": "真美……其实，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1069_012mam", "source_sha256": "1a7ace267bfe84b757dc1f14cb743acb055fd7ef430bf0e057775d023552f144", "ja": "じ、実は、双子なんだよね！！\n妹がいるんだ！　亜美っていうんだけど。", "zh": "其、其实，我是双胞胎啦！！\n我有个妹妹！她叫亚美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1070_012mam", "source_sha256": "7d4ee599bbcc8c6551d65661cd9aec670386cff19ce303f4d5f487e24f26b023", "ja": "えっと。だからその、写真集は……。", "zh": "那个。所以说，写真集……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1071_kano", "source_sha256": "703a0d26875133032f8d9f24cac985a74d87d27538d8b66453ca19e65c7ec681", "ja": "あ、もしかして妹さんと一緒がいいとか？", "zh": "啊，难道你是想和妹妹一起吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1072_012mam", "source_sha256": "8cbb6c9dfd1bddeefb1838d4f5a8b39eaf851f9672912fa29ecaf4832b86ca9a", "ja": "う、ううん！　そんなコトないよ！\n真美を撮りたいって言われて、うれしかったし……。", "zh": "不、不是！才没有那回事！\n听到你说想给真美拍照，我很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1073_kano", "source_sha256": "e1f50360961c1cddb4d8b5db9d5602a62997834a02f3f11c60e99e1ac960f6ad", "ja": "良かった！　真美さんは真美さんです。\n大丈夫、双子だから同じだなんて言いませんよ！", "zh": "太好了！真美就是独一无二的真美。放心，我不会因为你们是双胞胎就说你们一模一样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1074_012mam", "source_sha256": "ca871e67dedac4b528378bc75a6aac67113c10c14245d558a0b29a1744a94a6f", "ja": "あ、ありがと……。そ、そんでね！\n真美、撮ってほしい写真があるんだけど！", "zh": "啊、谢谢……那、那个呢！\n真美有张想让你帮忙拍的照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1075_kano", "source_sha256": "51f10116563e99888bfcc1a9c6636dcf7ef57660a62b1f5ddd9d01ceb25cb334", "ja": "どんな写真ですか？", "zh": "这是什么照片？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1076_012mam", "source_sha256": "a4d3d9bd7aecbe6fec3aca376f15deb33bdab921e9ce97dd25d5a7dc2006c00e", "ja": "んとね、めっちゃセクシーなやつ！", "zh": "嗯～就是超级性感的照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1077_kano", "source_sha256": "7340219d7d7fa9768b27430eb1788997b8452f4bcd5c166bae536dbc7ae14e9e", "ja": "あ、それはダメです。", "zh": "啊，那样不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1078_012mam", "source_sha256": "e56c417bcdca323a9e0edac836591770e58afff30e273a376f4af179f6517134", "ja": "なんでー！？", "zh": "为什么——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1079_kano", "source_sha256": "6a1d40393b5bd419afa9fcb3093bc0adfd7f8d69794815ab2319e248249c3b34", "ja": "なんでって言われても、ダメなものはダメかと……\nそういうのは、大人になってからでも遅くないですし。", "zh": "你要问为什么的话，不行就是不行吧……  \n这种事等长大以后再做也不迟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1080_kano", "source_sha256": "bffa1858f931435d8bec46c35bb720340c6403eb386923824dcaeb49005615c8", "ja": "今の、年相応の真美さんで十分魅力的ですから。", "zh": "现在这样、符合年龄的真美，就已经很有魅力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1081_012mam", "source_sha256": "9fadc0b718d3f1dcd7075e4c7f1b30dc26d72268812488f5bc7e9b9672eda865", "ja": "なんで兄ちゃんと同じコト言うの～！？", "zh": "为什么跟哥哥说一样的话嘛～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1082_p", "source_sha256": "ff81d37eacdee8a3767dc3f9024eb9ea12c3188c991df0ab01eb6b2e256bce38", "ja": "ん？　……あれ、真美？\nこんなところで何してるんだ？", "zh": "嗯？……咦，真美？\n你在这种地方做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1083_012mam", "source_sha256": "e525928700098b1b1952335c49c503720e89974e50e7e1b6137410d9d832ca00", "ja": "！？　に、兄ちゃん……！？", "zh": "！？哥、哥哥……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1084_kano", "source_sha256": "f39d20d7752bcfe773ab75ed64cb2b830bb3966c792e2de451757c7b2cbccf58", "ja": "兄ちゃん？\nあっ、真美さんのお兄さんですね！", "zh": "哥哥？\n啊，你就是真美小姐的哥哥吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1085_p", "source_sha256": "147161e2cebb4a1d8d71896615336f1459f410792d465241e7ec03e4145b24f6", "ja": "え？　あ、いや兄ではないんですけど、\nその……。", "zh": "诶？啊，不，我不是她哥哥，\n那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1086_012mam", "source_sha256": "95199cafbb97bc4253c2c41483d75d295e6aa00235c488f3a3d22419749c3a54", "ja": "うぅ……ぐすっ。\n兄ちゃ～ん……。ごべんなさい～……。", "zh": "呜呜……抽泣。\n哥～哥……对不起～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1089_p", "source_sha256": "4b2bc46d1296f981981a7a43b2760c9c8327000ac9fcf62fb7d4b8fb262da696", "ja": "（假野さんという人と少し話しをして別れ、\n真美を連れて一度劇場へ戻ってきた）", "zh": "（我和假野先生稍微聊了几句后告别，带着真美回了一趟剧场）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1090_012mam", "source_sha256": "d53f099b7344da657842434823722a9a9520afe24337aeaa049306a62ca042d1", "ja": "ごめんなさい……。", "zh": "对不起……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1091_012mam", "source_sha256": "38aad41c08cea316d6fa07b886701acfdd13e8b1817ca5f526393d3b27aced55", "ja": "なんか、あの姉ちゃん……\n真美の写真撮るの、すごく楽しそうで……。", "zh": "总觉得，那个姐姐……给真美拍照的时候，好像特别开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1092_p", "source_sha256": "7b481cd2e3a9d7048733d13c4a09c8a6561b7a454bad45c1187e839f959538d8", "ja": "それで、言えなくなっちゃったのか。", "zh": "所以，你就说不出口了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1094_p", "source_sha256": "364e7e020f3ea8fa0a4d8a5c1c75d1bc91519332a40a26cb289d8233e8e2dff1", "ja": "そうだな……真美はもう13歳だから。自分の事は\n自分で決めたいって思うかもしれないけど。", "zh": "是啊……真美已经13岁了。或许她会觉得，自己的事情想自己做决定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1095_p", "source_sha256": "d1fa5834c1417c4ab3d37eff7dcbddfde7b30c7aec91465b38db8f1faa68ee9f", "ja": "でも13歳は、俺から見たら、やっぱり子どもだから。\n大人に頼ってほしいな。", "zh": "不过，在我看来，13岁终究还是个孩子。还是希望你能依靠大人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1096_p", "source_sha256": "e1f1023cb5a6c610b172935767f51491cddb49153bd07356f63c945c883c3222", "ja": "信頼してくれてるんだろ？", "zh": "你是信任我的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1097_012mam", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1098_p", "source_sha256": "95974969c28730d90d47e8dca6d7ca69ad9471724f8a15a47d007090c75632a1", "ja": "ありがとう。\n後で、一緒に假野さんに謝りに行こうな。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n待会儿我们一起去向假野小姐道歉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1099_012mam", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1100_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1101_012mam", "source_sha256": "d53f099b7344da657842434823722a9a9520afe24337aeaa049306a62ca042d1", "ja": "ごめんなさい……。", "zh": "对不起……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1102_p", "source_sha256": "c8a2da63900de73ab7a0c04f99ee3b26ce1d42e5c1ffc7ade551e0f7643d3f4d", "ja": "この度は、ご迷惑をお掛けしてしまって\n本当にすみませんでした。", "zh": "这次给您添麻烦了，真的非常抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1103_kano", "source_sha256": "891eb8d71218e3df363aa2fa15bda3dbc04c468004c9640c9ea3a76e1a990bef", "ja": "そんな、迷惑だなんて。\n私も、もっときちんと話をすれば良かったので。", "zh": "怎么会说是给我添麻烦呢。\n我也应该更好好地和你说清楚才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1104_p", "source_sha256": "c74d48053a11b894e66d204417286ef8422e14f922011d318012525178d47eed", "ja": "写真は事務所のチェックさえ通して頂ければ、外に\n出して頂いて問題ありません。ご面倒をお掛けします。", "zh": "照片只要通过事务所的审核，发布到外面也没问题。给您添麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1105_kano", "source_sha256": "8a5cf6836fe0251b4581fb009a8be55d2227a26b4b52d73343a111bab4147885", "ja": "わかりました、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "知道了，谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1106_p", "source_sha256": "4b54a4cd252f1c11eafeb515eff85f761a8ed7fab91d41ced12a7637c2a243f1", "ja": "あの、ひとつ聞かせて頂きたいんですが……\nどうして、真美だったんですか？", "zh": "那个，我想请问一下……\n为什么选了真美呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1107_p", "source_sha256": "a4cbb88d31e1397e5ae316172606e5a54a76c685ee1f28704903b69b42530753", "ja": "声を掛けられた時、他のアイドル達も\n一緒だったと聞いたので。", "zh": "我听说被搭话的时候，\n其他偶像也在场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1108_kano", "source_sha256": "d9bf21dd78831d8c74c428d6074201f4c3c38f3f17bdef18edd1ee4aa24d4380", "ja": "えっと、最初に見かけた時、高校生かと思ったんです。\n手足が長くて、雰囲気が大人っぽかったので。", "zh": "那个，我第一次见到你的时候，还以为你是高中生。\n因为你的四肢修长，给人的感觉也很成熟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1109_kano", "source_sha256": "5975d16fc827f6074b898c1f65b29cdae68f336f1b7e1cd3c404e82ada5c3c6d", "ja": "でも話してみたら、すぐ中学生だってわかって……。", "zh": "不过聊了几句后，很快就发现她是初中生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1110_012mam", "source_sha256": "a75f588ec51c80ee0bd6d5ee70a14396ff2473fcaea52971f60d922adab28d1d", "ja": "うえっ！！？", "zh": "咦！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1111_kano", "source_sha256": "b4bfb109b46df87743b68d7de065bc11d9daf30f4be1bc4345c1da8e0b809d0c", "ja": "見た目の大人っぽさと、話した時のあどけなさの\nギャップ……っていうんでしょうか。", "zh": "外表的成熟感和交谈时的天真烂漫之间的\n落差……该怎么说呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1112_kano", "source_sha256": "f74d2fec023d612a32b56b4752c358d5202879f15242c88058dfb1cb5782a7d3", "ja": "そういう、大人になりかけている女の子の\n記録みたいなものを、残したかったんです。", "zh": "我想留下那种即将长大成人的女孩子的记录。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1113_p", "source_sha256": "93fd5a4759e83716bb00ee501259799f18b01808e0a72d75e273e27a584871e7", "ja": "そうですか……ありがとうございます。\nそれを聞いて納得しました。", "zh": "这样啊……谢谢您。\n听您这么说，我就明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1114_p", "source_sha256": "ca46d3266b375d78f776857a2d87698ca5b336e39b43291afb5ebb7738dff1f9", "ja": "それと……真美、言う事があるんだろ？", "zh": "还有……真美，你有话要说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1115_012mam", "source_sha256": "8ca1fa0f8ccae8f2fda9b5464bf07754c7008b4d166c171308c1a5f0c83b8b08", "ja": "あっ、うん。　……あのね！\nもしよかったらなんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，对。……那个，如果你愿意的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1116_012mam", "source_sha256": "3ebc79bc3c867138fb1cb7f41019b690aa87b58fa38ed5605d037ddbf3009093", "ja": "真美、今度の公演でセンターやるんだ。\n真美のステージ、観に来てくれる……？", "zh": "真美要在下次公演中担任C位。\n你愿意来看真美的舞台吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_164_1117_kano", "source_sha256": "c8ebeac7378b548b5927737465b107c08b331a252ff00b96c31701ae6b2feb8a", "ja": "もちろん！\n観に行かせてもらいますね！", "zh": "当然了！\n我一定会去看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
